# Dirtree: Stateful directory trees in the CLI for humans and LLMs. https://github.com/pmarreck/dirtree
ver=1.2
annotate=[
	ADR.tsv = Fleet decision log (TSV, printable-binary encoded fields); adr-0001 documents its own format
	MECHATRON_PRIME_CI.md = Portable Mechatron Prime CI target, webhook, and badge policy.
	PLAN.md = Active and recently completed work for the shared cross-agent skill repository.
	about-peter = Directory symlink to the private about-peter skill whose SKILL.md remains outside this public repo.
	capture-collaboration-evidence = Proactively identifies and records artifact-backed cases where human-agent synthesis beats either starting approach.
	deep-code-review = Audit a codebase or major subsystem for quality and missed issues at project milestones.
	dispatch = Dispatch background subagents for substantial tasks, fanning out parallel work with progress checkpointing.
	erect-agent-stack = Stand up or join a project's agent stack — tmux session + remoted coding agent — in one idempotent command.
	fix-zig-deps-hash = Fix nix build zigDeps/zigDepsHash mismatches after build.zig.zon dependency changes.
	flake.nix = Pure Nix test environment declaring Bash, LuaJIT, and every suite tool and patched script interpreter.
	handoff = Condense current dev state into a handoff doc conveying purpose and intent to the next agent.
	i18n = Canonical i18n discipline: 50-locale set, compile-time enforcement, bilingual errors, RTL, --lang/--help conventions.
	i18n/SKILL.md = Canonical opt-in i18n discipline: scope decision gate, 50 locales, enforcement, bilingual errors, RTL, and localized CLI conventions.
	install = Cross-platform installer linking one physical skill repo into Claude and Codex with recoverable legacy migration.
	llmsend = Inter-session/inter-machine LLMsend messaging skill (symlink into the ../llmsend project).
	llvm-guided-optimization = Optimize Zig hot paths via hand-tuned LLVM IR when algorithmic gains are exhausted.
	mechatron-ci = Shared Mechatron Prime CI skill with Codex UI metadata.
	memories = Shared cross-agent workflow for typed durable memory recall, migration, validation, and consolidation.
	memories/SKILL.md = Generic public contract for durable shared/project memory recall, UTC metadata, migration, validation, and consolidation.
	memories/scripts/check-frontmatter = Validates memory YAML headers while pruning VCS metadata and generated .codescan search indexes.
	memories/scripts/list-titles = Lists shared and project memory titles or validated headers; sourceable as list_memory_titles.
	memories/scripts/migrate-legacy = Previews or safely migrates legacy memories, preserving bodies and rendering creation instants as UTC.
	mfic = Design/judge tests and gates for trustworthiness — Mechanically-Falsifiable Independent Controls for LLM-produced work.
	onboard/SKILL.md = onboard skill: rebuild a dead session's context from its on-disk transcript (converse of handoff)
	onboard/scripts/collect-claude-context = Bash: day-anchored session selection for a cwd, reduces and concatenates for a summarising subagent
	onboard/scripts/reduce-claude-transcript = LuaJIT: reduce one Claude session .jsonl to Markdown ~18x smaller; whitelisted record types, unknown = hard error
	scaffold-zig-project = Scaffold a new greenfield Zig project from scratch.
	ship = Commit and push known-green work, watch Mechatron Prime CI, or cut a tagged GitHub release.
	supacode-cli = Control Supacode from the terminal — worktrees, tabs, and surfaces managed programmatically.
	test = Runs the complete llm_skills installer and skill-policy regression suite.
	tests/cli/test_i18n_scope_policy = Regression guard for the i18n skill's explicit owner-decision and RULES.md recording gate.
	tests/cli/test_install = Regression tests for installer options, canonical skill-root links, shared metadata, and rerun safety.
	tests/cli/test_memories = Regression-tests frontmatter validation, legacy migration, repository scaffolding, and .codescan pruning.
	tests/cli/test_memory_titles = Classifies shared/project memory discovery and proves headers ignore VCS and .codescan metadata.
	tests/cli/test_onboard_collect = tests day-anchored selection: whole newest day, size-floor walk-back, calendar bound, --list/--session
	tests/cli/test_onboard_reducer = classifier-over-sets tests for the reducer: sensitivity, specificity, payload bound, reduction ratio, drift failure
	tests/cli/test_retired_garnix_guidance = Regression gate preventing shared workflows from resurrecting retired Garnix CI guidance.
	tests/cli/test_zero_copy_install = Integration test for zero-copy Codex skill installation, safe legacy archival, idempotence, and hook retirement.
	zig-microbenchmarks = Add benchmarks to a Zig project, track hot-path performance, and investigate regressions.
]
